[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6182.07, "timestamp": "01:43:02", "text": "彼らの嘔吐物の上に吐く。実際にはそうではない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6184.55, "timestamp": "01:43:04", "text": "ニース。実際に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6188.07, "timestamp": "01:43:08", "text": "まるで彼らは本当にとても"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6190.31, "timestamp": "01:43:10", "text": "生命を脅かすほど深刻な状況だとどう表現すればいいでしょうか。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6191.91, "timestamp": "01:43:11", "text": "もしあなたが自分のものを選んだら、あなたは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6193.75, "timestamp": "01:43:13", "text": "何をすべきかを知っている。うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6199.83, "timestamp": "01:43:19", "text": "いいね、そして時々、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6200.617, "timestamp": "01:43:20", "author": "@gaurdiangaming4603", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mFiZLBZWkzinaMdP6tEYkP1j69A0G3jL01PKtnzXI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "flavored alcohol has flavoring and it has oils to flavor it. which has a thick consistency so it sticks and can often have a bad aftertaste"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6201.99, "timestamp": "01:43:21", "text": "水、水を与えてください、または"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6203.669, "timestamp": "01:43:23", "text": "水があれば何かあるが、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6205.43, "timestamp": "01:43:25", "text": "彼らを完全に助ける必要はない。チェックするだけです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6207.43, "timestamp": "01:43:27", "text": "それらをすれば、それで終わりです。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6207.627, "timestamp": "01:43:27", "author": "@notpravinlol", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/t9UXLD6AmzS1-YItB_6_Kz4uAutM3H0oNxaU47_WUxq4oWNpbcDQvZiftO3UE0nS_-jgazDe=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "turn them sideways"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6210.149, "timestamp": "01:43:30", "text": "先ほども言ったように、日本は本当に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6213.109, "timestamp": "01:43:33", "text": "極度の内向的な人に最適"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6216.27, "timestamp": "01:43:36", "text": "私たち。本当に本当に良いです。それで"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6218.395, "timestamp": "01:43:38", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pLVydQ_mLyNSXpDD2A2gNJXBLHO228IzT5zq41iTuqUdmG_2xiIlg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Where they throwing up rainbow?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6220.03, "timestamp": "01:43:40", "text": "みんなみんな"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6222.39, "timestamp": "01:43:42", "text": "「自分のことに集中しろ」ってどう言えばいいかな"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6223.99, "timestamp": "01:43:43", "text": "仕事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6226.87, "timestamp": "01:43:46", "text": "みんな自分のことに集中しているが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6229.43, "timestamp": "01:43:49", "text": "いくつかやってみようと思うなら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6230.95, "timestamp": "01:43:50", "text": "日本人は自分のことに集中すべきだと言う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6232.55, "timestamp": "01:43:52", "text": "ビジネスでは、誰もあなたの髪を染めることはできません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6234.55, "timestamp": "01:43:54", "text": "目を賭けて、あなたは着ることができます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6236.149, "timestamp": "01:43:56", "text": "コスプレグッズは誰も目を向けない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6238.83, "timestamp": "01:43:58", "text": "彼らはより良く行い、"}]